{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this RTS game you will take command of an armada of combat spaceships and become the architect of mankind's last hope - an orbital station built in the heart of the universe. Your goal is to hold on for as long as possible while fending off increasingly powerful enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan the location of buildings, improve the fleet, distribute resources and make strategic decisions, on which depends not only your life, but also the fate of the entire sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Develop your own base in outer space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Build and upgrade ships for defense and offense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Fight waves of opponents and maintain control of the situation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Tactical depth and intense gameplay for true strategists</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695120?t=1746273937","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695120?t=1746273937","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695120/fed3585af705a47ff2dfe2ab082784bdeb6cc352/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746273937","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695120/fed3585af705a47ff2dfe2ab082784bdeb6cc352/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746273937","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this RTS game you will take command of an armada of combat spaceships and become the architect of mankind's last hope - an orbital station built in the heart of the universe. Your goal is to hold on for as long as possible while fending off increasingly powerful enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan the location of buildings, improve t